      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 3.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "right then, come on in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.88,
      "end_seconds": 6.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Evening, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.41,
      "end_seconds": 10.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.65,
      "end_seconds": 30.33,
      "duration_seconds": 14.68,
      "text": "Doctor, it's no real problems. It's getting on my nerves now. I just want to get back to normal, really. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.44,
      "end_seconds": 38.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.24,
      "end_seconds": 42.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.11,
      "end_seconds": 62.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.98,
      "end_seconds": 73.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "text": "Okay, so probably five days. Yeah. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.74,
      "end_seconds": 79.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I see, go ahead rate it it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.05,
      "end_seconds": 85.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Okay, so pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.85,
      "end_seconds": 89.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.55,
      "end_seconds": 101.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "An occasional headache goes along with it, most of the time. The occasional headache? That's been for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.77,
      "end_seconds": 117.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Have you noticed shortness of breath, weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.71,
      "end_seconds": 122.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "none of those, you know, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.06,
      "end_seconds": 127.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.59,
      "end_seconds": 139.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, uh, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.41,
      "end_seconds": 144.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.23,
      "end_seconds": 149.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.19,
      "end_seconds": 155.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.71,
      "end_seconds": 177.51,
      "duration_seconds": 18.8,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I swim twice a week. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.34,
      "end_seconds": 183.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.17,
      "end_seconds": 188.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Mm, no, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.76,
      "end_seconds": 192.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.8,
      "end_seconds": 201.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.67,
      "end_seconds": 228.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 69 beats a minute, pressure 110 over 81, SpO2 97 percent on room air, temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.15,
      "end_seconds": 233.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Let's move on to the the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.16,
      "end_seconds": 236.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.94,
      "end_seconds": 255.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "your heart and lungs sound normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.66,
      "end_seconds": 260.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.47,
      "end_seconds": 289.69,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "so where does that that leave us? The most likely explanation is a healthy adult with no worrying findings. Let's get a cholesterol blood test, for routine check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.29,
      "end_seconds": 292.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Right, um, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.42,
      "end_seconds": 298.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.03,
      "end_seconds": 302.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.75,
      "end_seconds": 305.22,
